t hand for Open ModPlug Tracker) is completely free and allows you to create and play back some great music on your computer. Based on the original ModPlug Tracker written by Olivier Lapicque, OpenMPT is free software, can import a wide variety of module formats and offers an intuitive, native GUI as well as advanced features such as VST plugins and ASIO output.\nIn addition to its own song format, OpenMPT can natively edit Impulse Tracker, FastTracker, Scream Tracker and ProTracker module files. Read more about it on the features page!","moniker":"openmpt","name":"OpenMPT","packageUrl":"https://openmpt.org/","publisher":"OpenMPT","publisherUrl":"https://openmpt.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://openmpt.org/release_notes/History.txt","tags":["audio","modplug","music","tracker"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"A powerful audio application that makes writing music fun, easy and efficient.","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"OpenMPT 是一款流行的适用于 Windows 的 tracker 软件。OpenMPT（Open ModPlug Tracker 的缩写）完全免费，让你在电脑上创作和播放绝佳的音乐。OpenMPT 是一款免费软件，基于 Olivier Lapicque 编写的原始 ModPlug Tracker，可导入多种模块格式，并拥有直观的原生图形用户界面以及 VST 插件和 ASIO 输出等高级功能。\n除了自带的歌曲格式外，OpenMPT 还能原生编辑 Impulse Tracker、FastTracker、Scream Tracker 和 ProTracker 模块文件。如需了解更多信息，请访问功能页面！","name":"OpenMPT","publisher":"OpenMPT","releaseNotesUrl":"https://openmpt.org/release_notes/History.txt","tags":["modplug","tracker","音乐","音频"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openmpt.org/","releaseDate":"2026-03-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://openmpt.org/release_notes/History.txt","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/o/OpenMPT/OpenMPT/1.32.08.00/OpenMPT.OpenMPT.yaml","sha256":"2b2753805ea15191618e966fb83c9f00b59bb23f9bb14ee8326a6f4f1c176f3a"},{"path":"manifests/o/OpenMPT/OpenMPT/1.32.08.00/OpenMPT.OpenMPT.installer.yaml","sha256":"e88e549df97a274499af3b805beb0f4e18ad475418a98fe6e01169dde72b0b70"},{"path":"ma